{"id": "6e64e406-3b2e-44a7-a9c7-aae77bffeb54", "slug": "architecture-matrices", "title": "Architecture Matrices", "description": "Architecture Matrices Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Architecture Matrices\"\ndescription: \"Architecture Matrices Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FBBF24\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#F43F5E\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#171717\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Architecture Matrices\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 6; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nArchitecture Matrices Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nArchitecture Matrices Unearth your structural dynamics. Map the invisible operational schemas defining your output. We analyze the foundational layers that govern deployment, stability, and infinite scale. Commence Anal…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Unearth your structural dynamics.; The Architect; The Optimizer; The Catalyst; The Vanguard.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FBBF24, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #F43F5E, background #FFFFFF, surface #171717, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Architecture Matrices</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-100 antialiased selection:bg-neutral-800 selection:text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center overflow-x-hidden\" style=\"font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Layer -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full -z-20 pointer-events-none opacity-60\"></canvas>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 -z-10 pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-950/40 via-neutral-950/80 to-neutral-950\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 -z-10 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 32px 32px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1280px] min-h-screen px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-12 py-24 md:py-32 flex flex-col justify-start\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"mb-20 md:mb-28 max-w-4xl flex flex-col items-start z-10\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 text-xs font-light text-neutral-400 mb-8 tracking-widest uppercase backdrop-blur-md shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:network-linear\" class=\"text-neutral-300\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>Architecture Matrices</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <h1 id=\"reveal-title\" class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl leading-[1.05] text-white mb-8 font-light tracking-tighter opacity-0\">\n                Unearth your structural dynamics.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12\">\n                Map the invisible operational schemas defining your output. We analyze the foundational layers that govern deployment, stability, and infinite scale.\n            </p>\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white text-black px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-normal tracking-tight hover:bg-neutral-200 hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] group\">\n                Commence Analysis\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Complex Bento Grid -->\n        <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 w-full auto-rows-[28rem] z-10\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: The Architect (Span 8) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-8 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent overflow-hidden group\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl -z-10 transition-colors group-hover:bg-neutral-900/70\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-8 z-10 relative\">\n                    <!-- Top Meta Details -->\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6\">\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-xs font-light text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400/80 animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]\"></div>\n                            System Integrity: 99.99%\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-xs font-light text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            Fault Tolerance: Active\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Schema Animation Canvas -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full flex-grow relative mb-8 border border-white/5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950/30 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                            <!-- Background Grid -->\n                            <pattern id=\"grid\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n                                <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" />\n                            </pattern>\n                            <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"url(#grid)\" />\n\n                            <!-- Connecting Schema Lines -->\n                            <g stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" fill=\"none\">\n                                <path d=\"M150 100 L300 50 L450 100 L300 150 Z\" />\n                                <path d=\"M150 100 L300 100 L450 100\" />\n                                <path d=\"M300 50 L300 150\" />\n                            </g>\n\n                            <!-- Animated Data Flow Paths -->\n                            <g stroke=\"rgba(167,139,250,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\">\n                                <path d=\"M150 100 L300 50 L450 100\" stroke-dasharray=\"100 300\" stroke-dashoffset=\"400\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"400\" to=\"0\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </path>\n                                <path d=\"M150 100 L300 150 L450 100\" stroke-dasharray=\"100 300\" stroke-dashoffset=\"400\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"400\" to=\"0\" dur=\"4s\" begin=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </path>\n                                <path d=\"M300 50 L300 150\" stroke-dasharray=\"50 100\" stroke-dashoffset=\"150\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"150\" to=\"0\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </path>\n                            </g>\n\n                            <!-- Nodes -->\n                            <g fill=\"rgba(23,23,23,1)\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"12\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"50\" r=\"12\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"150\" r=\"12\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"100\" r=\"12\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"100\" r=\"16\" stroke=\"rgba(167,139,250,0.5)\" />\n                            </g>\n\n                            <!-- Pulsing Indicators on Nodes -->\n                            <g fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.8)\">\n                                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"150\" r=\"3\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"100\" r=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(167,139,250,1)\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.4;1;0.4\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"4;6;4\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </circle>\n                            </g>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"max-w-md\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">The Architect</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Constructs resilient, highly available ecosystems. Designs for zero-downtime scalability and rigid structural integrity from inception.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"hidden md:flex flex-col gap-2 min-w-[140px]\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-light text-neutral-500\">\n                                <span>Redundancy</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-neutral-300\">N+1</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white/10\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-light text-neutral-500\">\n                                <span>Protocol</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-neutral-300\">gRPC</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: The Optimizer (Span 4) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent overflow-hidden group\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl -z-10 transition-colors group-hover:bg-neutral-900/70\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8 z-10 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">Yield Schema</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-3 rounded-full bg-white/20 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-4 rounded-full bg-white/40 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-delay: 150ms;\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"w-1 h-5 rounded-full bg-white/80 animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-delay: 300ms;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Tree Schema Animation -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full flex-grow flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-white/5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950/30 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                            <g stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                                <path d=\"M100 40 L100 60\" />\n                                <path d=\"M100 60 L60 100\" />\n                                <path d=\"M100 60 L140 100\" />\n                                <path d=\"M60 100 L40 140\" />\n                                <path d=\"M60 100 L80 140\" />\n                                <path d=\"M140 100 L120 140\" />\n                                <path d=\"M140 100 L160 140\" />\n                            </g>\n\n                            <!-- Optimization Sweep -->\n                            <g stroke=\"rgba(56,189,248,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n                                <path d=\"M100 40 L100 60 L140 100 L120 140\" stroke-dasharray=\"20 200\" stroke-dashoffset=\"220\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"220\" to=\"-20\" dur=\"2.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </path>\n                            </g>\n\n                            <g fill=\"rgba(23,23,23,1)\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.3)\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n                                <rect x=\"90\" y=\"25\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" />\n                                <rect x=\"50\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" />\n                                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"100\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" />\n                                <rect x=\"30\" y=\"140\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" />\n                                <rect x=\"70\" y=\"140\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" />\n                                <rect x=\"110\" y=\"140\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" stroke=\"rgba(56,189,248,0.6)\" />\n                                <rect x=\"150\" y=\"140\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\" />\n                            </g>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">The Optimizer</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n                            Eliminates computational overhead. Refines logical pathways to guarantee maximum throughput with minimal resource expenditure.\n                        </p>\n                        <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-300\">Auto-Pruning</span>\n                            <div class=\"w-8 h-4 rounded-full bg-sky-500/20 relative border border-sky-500/30\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute right-0.5 top-0.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-sky-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(56,189,248,0.6)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: The Catalyst (Span 5) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-5 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent overflow-hidden group\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl -z-10 transition-colors group-hover:bg-neutral-900/70\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col p-6 md:p-8 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-light text-neutral-400 tracking-widest uppercase\">Pipeline Matrix</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-normal text-amber-400/80 tracking-widest uppercase\">-40ms Latency</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Pipeline Schema Animation -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center mb-6 relative border border-white/5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950/30 p-4\">\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 100\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"2\" />\n\n                            <!-- Moving Signal -->\n                            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"270\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"rgba(251,191,36,0.8)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"40 300\" stroke-dashoffset=\"340\">\n                                <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"340\" to=\"-40\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                            </line>\n\n                            <!-- Pipeline Stages -->\n                            <g fill=\"rgba(23,23,23,1)\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\">\n                                <rect x=\"30\" y=\"35\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" />\n                                <rect x=\"130\" y=\"35\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" />\n                                <rect x=\"230\" y=\"35\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" />\n                            </g>\n\n                            <!-- Node Pulses -->\n                            <g fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\">\n                                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5);rgba(251,191,36,1);rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </circle>\n                                <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5);rgba(251,191,36,1);rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"0.6s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </circle>\n                                <circle cx=\"250\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"fill\" values=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.5);rgba(251,191,36,1);rgba(255,255,255,0.5)\" dur=\"2s\" begin=\"1.2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </circle>\n                            </g>\n                        </svg>\n\n                        <!-- Sub-metric Progress -->\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto w-full pt-4 border-t border-white/5\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs font-light text-neutral-500 mb-1.5\">\n                                <span>Deployment Loop</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-neutral-300\">87%</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"h-1 w-full bg-white/10 rounded-full overflow-hidden\">\n                                <div class=\"h-full bg-amber-400/80 w-[87%] relative shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(251,191,36,0.5)]\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            The Catalyst\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-amber-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">\n                            Bypasses systemic friction to force immediate execution. Triggers rapid deployment loops and severely accelerates time-to-market.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: The Vanguard (Span 7) -->\n            <div class=\"md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-7 relative p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent overflow-hidden group\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl -z-10 transition-colors group-hover:bg-neutral-900/70\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"h-full w-full flex flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-8 z-10\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\">\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-xs font-light text-neutral-400\">Velocity: Tier 1</span>\n                            <span class=\"px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-xs font-light text-neutral-400\">Iteration: Continuous</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-neutral-500 animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite]\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Radar/Cyclic Schema -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full flex-grow relative overflow-hidden mb-6 border border-white/5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950/30 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                        <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"absolute inset-0\">\n                            <g transform=\"translate(200, 100)\">\n                                <!-- Concentric Schema Rings -->\n                                <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"40\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"70\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.1)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 8\" />\n                                <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"100\" stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n\n                                <!-- Orbiting Elements -->\n                                <g>\n                                    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"0\" to=\"360\" dur=\"8s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                    <circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(244,63,94,0.8)\" />\n                                    <path d=\"M 70 0 A 70 70 0 0 1 0 70\" stroke=\"rgba(244,63,94,0.4)\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" />\n                                </g>\n                                <g>\n                                    <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"360\" to=\"0\" dur=\"12s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                    <circle cx=\"-100\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.6)\" />\n                                    <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.6)\" />\n                                </g>\n\n                                <!-- Core -->\n                                <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(23,23,23,1)\" stroke=\"rgba(244,63,94,0.6)\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                                    <animate attributeName=\"r\" values=\"12;14;12\" dur=\"2s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n                                </circle>\n                                <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(244,63,94,1)\" />\n                            </g>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"max-w-md\">\n                            <h3 class=\"text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">The Vanguard</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm font-light text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed\">\n                                Drives aggressive early-stage momentum. Rejects administrative bloat in favor of continuous, high-velocity iteration cycles.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-md border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:rocket-2-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-neutral-300\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Minimal Three.js Particle Grid Background\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x0a0a0a, 0.03);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n            camera.position.set(0, 4, 15);\n            camera.lookAt(0, -2, 0);\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            const size = 50;\n            const segments = 50;\n            const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = segments * segments;\n            const positions = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            let index = 0;\n            for(let i = 0; i < segments; i++) {\n                for(let j = 0; j < segments; j++) {\n                    const x = (i - segments / 2) * (size / segments);\n                    const z = (j - segments / 2) * (size / segments);\n                    positions[index * 3] = x;\n                    positions[index * 3 + 1] = 0;\n                    positions[index * 3 + 2] = z;\n                    index++;\n                }\n            }\n\n            geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(positions, 3));\n\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.04,\n                color: 0x888888,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.3,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const points = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);\n            points.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 6;\n            scene.add(points);\n\n            let clock = new THREE.Clock();\n            function animate() {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                const positions = geometry.attributes.position.array;\n                for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount; i++) {\n                    const i3 = i * 3;\n                    const x = positions[i3];\n                    const z = positions[i3 + 2];\n\n                    // Controlled subtle undulation mapping a terrain/schema\n                    positions[i3 + 1] = Math.sin(x * 0.2 + elapsedTime * 0.4) * 0.6 +\n                                        Math.cos(z * 0.2 + elapsedTime * 0.2) * 0.6;\n                }\n                geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n                points.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.015;\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            }\n            animate();\n\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n\n            // GSAP Title Reveal Animation\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const titleEl = document.getElementById('reveal-title');\n            if (titleEl) {\n                const text = titleEl.innerText;\n                titleEl.innerText = '';\n                titleEl.style.opacity = 1;\n\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n\n                words.forEach((word) => {\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    wrapper.style.paddingRight = '0.25em';\n                    wrapper.style.lineHeight = '1.05';\n\n                    const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                    inner.innerText = word;\n                    inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n                    inner.style.transformOrigin = 'top left';\n\n                    wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                    titleEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n                });\n\n                setTimeout(() => {\n                    gsap.to('#reveal-title > span > span', {\n                        y: '0%',\n                        ease: 'power4.out',\n                        duration: 1.4,\n                        stagger: 0.05,\n                        scrollTrigger: {\n                            trigger: '#reveal-title',\n                            start: 'top 90%',\n                            toggleActions: 'play none none none'\n                        }\n                    });\n                }, 100);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "architecture-matrices.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/architecture-matrices.jpg", "source_name": "architecture-matrices-DESIGN.md", "views": 50, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T08:27:58.415855+00:00"}